sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Screen / Redux
    participant SM as syncManager
    participant Q as offlineQueue (AsyncStorage)
    participant AF as authFetch
    participant API as Backend /mvp-sessions

    Note over UI,API: Player offline — score + status edits
    UI->>SM: queueOperation({entity:'game', op:'update', payload:{method:'PUT',endpoint,body}, version:5})
    SM->>Q: enqueue(op)  // allocates unique id + monotonic sequence
    Q-->>SM: {id, sequence}

    Note over UI,API: Connectivity restored (NetInfo / socket connect / AppState)
    SM->>SM: startSync()  // syncInProgress guard
    SM->>Q: sorted operations (by sequence)
    loop each op in sequence order
        SM->>AF: fetch(endpoint, method, body, X-Entity-Version:5, X-Idempotency-Key:id)
        AF->>API: PUT …/games/g1/score
        alt 2xx (applied, version→6)
            API-->>AF: 200 {data:{version:6}}
            AF-->>SM: 200
            SM->>Q: remove(op.id)   // ONLY 2xx removes
        else 409 VERSION_CONFLICT
            API-->>AF: 409 {data:{current:{…}, serverVersion:7}}
            AF-->>SM: 409
            SM->>UI: dispatch(conflictDetected(record))   // server wins (LWW)
            SM->>Q: remove(op.id)   // replaced by conflict record, not lost
            UI->>UI: show OfflineStatusBanner('conflict') — unresolved conflicts visible
        else 5xx / timeout / network
            API-->>AF: 500 / abort
            SM->>Q: retryCount++, state:'queued'  // KEPT, backoff
        else 4xx permanent (400/403/404)
            API-->>AF: 403
            SM->>Q: state:'failed', lastError   // KEPT + surfaced, never dropped
        end
    end
    SM->>UI: dispatch(syncCompleted({synced, failed, conflicts}))
    SM->>UI: emit 'session:refetch'  // screens re-read authoritative state
